# The build context is an allowlist: only what the image's build needs (the Go module, the
# commands, the packages, the embedded web UI), so nothing else in this directory gets in,
# whatever it is called: the data directory (ESPDNS_DATA can name any directory here, not just
# data/), .env, local.mk, a binary built on the host, the browser tests.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/
# Not in a build, inside those either: the tests and their data
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
# Never in a build context, wherever one is put: a key, the login
**/*.pem
**/auth.json
